    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24242" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δευτερ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be second,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδενός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.55.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μετὰ τὸν βασιλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.73
