				10.11.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινί</span>”
				<i>to play second to . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Eum.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Es.</u>
